## Quick Reference — What Each State Means

| State | Meaning | Action |
|-------|---------|--------|
| IN_SERVICE | ATM working normally | No action |
| OUT_OF_SERVICE | ATM rejected by network | Dispatch field engineer |
| IN_SUPERVISOR | ATM in maintenance mode | Monitor, not an emergency |
| AGENT_DISCONNECTED | No data from ATM (power or network) | Check connectivity first |
| HARDWARE_FAULT | Card reader or dispenser error | Dispatch field engineer |
| OUT_OF_CASH | All cassettes empty | Schedule cash replenishment |
| OFFLINE | ATM not responding to ping | Check network then power |
| UNKNOWN | State not yet determined | Check Zabbix latest data |

